{"id": "DetytEygALm", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Do you say \"please\" and \"thank you\" to ChatGPT? You're adding to OpenAI's bill. 🙏💸\n\nA user asked Sam Altman how much electricity all that politeness costs. His reply: \"tens of millions of dollars well spent, you never know.\"\n\nWhy? Every word you send is processed on GPUs in a data centre. GPUs need power, power makes heat, heat needs cooling. One thank-you costs almost nothing, but crores of people saying it every day adds up.\n\nSo should you stop? Nah. Some people think polite prompts get slightly better answers. And when A.I. runs the world… it'll remember who was polite. 😌\n\nTag the friend who says thank you to ChatGPT 👇\n\n#chatgpt #openai #ai #samaltman #techinhindi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792567806, "like_count": 57, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18142107817575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 59.893, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPjwYnHJkFecFJR7hvPoWz02ofVFHi0mg4k7yuDHWwv7EiWskbe6iNzIvTC1HylDRnn73BarYDv4GQpli5p6Ihbvqpf_F9femTBUzw.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdqTvepKASwQPz6g5DY9PBoEFmcWfEu56zO_scO5EfnSv7UuccZEnFzD6Lj-pcxmp8_w-bS8YsH7fdt4AtUgyRc3&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=xrQs6j0O3soQ7kNvwE-uVSz&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=hvHgbWvZQL94eYRMxSty2Q&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQS_hYArkjOG7npbmvfYS8WLf6V4F1NbUJKJr4yBC_F-7Q&oe=6AF40D9C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 59.893, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.